      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners express deep appreciation for Dr. Leach, Dr. Wood, Dr. Jellineck, and the nursing staff. Longtime clients highlight decades of compassionate care, praising doctors for explaining diagnosis options clearly and without pressure. While one reviewer recalled past friction with reception, recent feedback reflects warm and attentive service."
      }
    },
