        "en": "Successful surgeries and acute recovery"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviews report dependable outcomes for both complex surgeries and acute medical treatments. Clients detail successful ear hematoma procedures, eye surgeries, mouth trauma repairs, and emergency care following coyote attacks. Cat owners especially emphasize excellent long-term wellness management that helped pets live healthy lives into their twenties."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "positive",
