      "title": {
        "en": "Prompt scheduling and same-day availability"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate the hospital's convenient operating hours and responsive scheduling. Several pet owners note that the clinic accommodated acute cases on the same day when other facilities had multi-day waiting periods. Reviewers find the booking process smooth and straightforward when urgent medical attention is required."
      }
    }
  ],
